"""
azvg-down: Download Azure DevOps variable groups
Usage: azvg-down <pattern|vg-name|vg-id> [options]

Downloads variable group(s) and saves them under ./variable-groups/ directory
in the current working directory. Can download by name, ID, pattern, or all variable groups.

Options:
    --all                    Download all variable groups
    -i, --ignore-case        Case-insensitive pattern matching
    -r, --regex              Use Perl-compatible regex instead of glob patterns
    
Examples:
    azvg-down 347                    # Download by ID
    azvg-down "My Variable Group"    # Download by exact name
    azvg-down "Prod*"                # Download all groups starting with "Prod"
    azvg-down --ignore-case "prod*"  # Case-insensitive pattern
    azvg-down -r "^(Dev|Test).*"     # Regex pattern
    azvg-down --all                  # Download all groups
"""

